{
  "info": {
    "name": "Zioto API",
    "description": "Zioto E-Commerce API Collection\n\nAll endpoints use `/api` prefix.\n\nAuthentication: Bearer token via `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` header.\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Send OTP → Verify OTP → (New users) Shahkar Verify\n2. Browse products, locations, shipping methods, blog\n3. Manage cart, wishlist, addresses\n4. Create order → Init payment → Handle callback",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "addressId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "provinceId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "shippingMethodId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"09123456789\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "send-otp"]
            },
            "description": "Send a one-time password to the given phone number.\n\nRate limited by `throttle:otp`.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `phone` (required): 11-digit Iranian mobile number (09XXXXXXXXX)\n\n**Response 200:** `{ \"message\": \"...\" }`\n**Response 429:** OTP already active, retry after 2 minutes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"09123456789\",\n  \"code\": \"12345\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"]
            },
            "description": "Verify the OTP code. If user exists, returns an API token. If user is new, returns a `token` for Shahkar registration.\n\nRate limited: 10 requests per minute.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `phone` (required): 11-digit mobile number\n- `code` (required): 5-digit OTP code\n\n**Response 200 (existing user):** `{ \"token\": \"...\", \"user\": {...} }`\n**Response 200 (new user):** `{ \"requires_registration\": true, \"token\": \"...\" }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Shahkar Verify (Register)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"from-verify-otp\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Ali\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Rezaei\",\n  \"national_code\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"birth_date\": \"1990-01-15\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/shahkar-verify",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "shahkar-verify"]
            },
            "description": "Complete registration for new users via Shahkar identity verification.\n\nRate limited: `throttle:shahkar`.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `token` (required): Token from verify-otp response\n- `first_name` (required): 2-50 chars\n- `last_name` (required): 2-50 chars\n- `national_code` (required): 10-digit national code\n- `birth_date` (optional): Date before today\n\n**Response 200:** `{ \"token\": \"api-token\", \"user\": {...} }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Logout and invalidate the current API token.\n\nRequires authentication.\n\n**Response 200:** `{ \"message\": \"...\" }`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
