              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a new address. Max 10 addresses per user.\n\nRequires authentication.\n\n**Request body:**\n- `province_id` (required): integer\n- `city_id` (required): integer\n- `address_line` (required): 10-1000 chars\n- `plate` (required): max 20 chars\n- `label`: max 50 chars\n- `district`: max 100 chars\n- `postal_code`: 10 digits\n- `unit`: max 20 chars\n- `receiver_name`: max 100 chars\n- `receiver_phone`: 09XXXXXXXXX\n- `receiver_national_code`: max 10 chars\n- `latitude`, `longitude`: numeric\n- `is_default`, `is_billing`: boolean\n\n**Response 201:** `{ \"message\": \"...\", \"address\": {...} }`"
          }
